// grmb planning rev 2 corpus. Hand-written against docs/design/grmb-planning.md;
// NOT machine-checked (no rev 2 parser exists yet). Findings below are what the
// rules in that document predict, to be confirmed by P0/P1.
// Stress 6: polling or pagination loop that is not a retry
//
// EXPECTED FINDINGS
//   retry would raise AMB002/PLAN016 and mislead (success, not failure, repeats)
//   Workaround: a step `fetch_all` with an outcome { ok, partial }; the loop lives in code
// NOT EXPRESSIBLE (see ../GAPS.md)
//   loop over a success outcome with a data-dependent exit -- GAPS.md G2

step system.fetch_page -> { ok, last_page };
scenario list realizes u.list_items {
  u.opens_list -> system.fetch_page => { ok -> end ok; last_page -> end ok; }
  // ok must repeat until last_page; retry is wrong (not a failure), no loop construct exists
}
